  "interpretation": "OIDS v0.2 now provides a validated diagnostic extension over the unchanged v0.1 protocol. It classifies registration and recovery error suppression, maps each ReiserFS development bug to a machine-readable repair obligation and three evidence-bearing safe alternatives, and rejects incomplete evidence. No safe alternative is proven in the evaluated ReiserFS source, so OIDS-O1 and OIDS-O3 remain violations. Btrfs, ext4, UBIFS, and OCFS2 regression boundaries are preserved, applicability is unchanged, and v0.2 held-out validation remains disabled.",
